Upstream: https://github.com/deepseek-ai/deepseek-harness
Adapted packages:
- packages/experimental/translator
- packages/experimental/client-ui-cot-translation

Local modifications add a PLaMo Chat Completions provider, configurable API
authentication, a portable bundle layout, and optional Windows API startup.
See scripts/build-vendor.py and upstream.json for reproducible source changes.

Model weights and llama.cpp binaries are not included in this repository.
